## First test

A new reviewed observation and a pending candidate enter a release fixture. The site shows the reviewed fact once, retains the candidate as non-aggregate, exposes provenance and coverage, and replays the prior edition after a failed candidate build.

## Actions and exit criteria

Build a new immutable static edition from accepted canonical facts only. Extend country/project routes, downloads, provenance and coverage indicators while preserving old editions and offline replay. No estimate or analytical snapshot becomes a canonical fact; any later analytical exhibit requires 0730 and an explicit derived label. No deployment is authorised.

